      {
        "id": "textbook-sqlist-type",
        "moduleId": "classification-and-storage",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材统一的顺序表类型",
        "markdown": "教材为后续算法统一了顺序表类型：$r[0]$ 闲置或用作哨兵单元，$r[1..n]$ 存放待排序记录。\n\n```c\n#define MAXSIZE 20\ntypedef int KeyType;\ntypedef struct {\n    KeyType key;\n    InfoType otherinfo;\n} RedType;\ntypedef struct {\n    RedType r[MAXSIZE + 1];\n    int length;\n} SqList;\n```\n\n哨兵的设计让插入类算法在向前搜索时可以同时后移记录，而不必每次都判断下标是否越界。",
